// A below-staff marcato on a low note must push the lyric line down so the
// syllable clears the mark (the script joins the staff's down-skyline the
// Lyrics row drops below). Regression: the 'v' used to overprint "Twin".
title "Lyrics below marcato"
tempo 100
time 4/4
key c major

part melody { clef treble
  section A { c4@marcato c g' g | a a g2 | }
}
lyrics words sings melody { section A { Twin- kle twin- kle | lit- tle star | } }
form main { A }
score main "lyrics-below-marcato" { staff melody with lyrics words }
